    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2906" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Antissa</span></b> , ae, f., =
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἄντισσα</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a town in the southern part of the
				island of Lesbos</i>, now <i>Kalas Limneonas</i>,
				<i><span class="en">Liv.
				45, 31</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Ov. M. 15, 287</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 5, 31,
				39, § 89</span></i>.—Hence, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">An-tissaei</span></b> , ōrum,
				m., <i>inhabitants of Antissa</i>,
				<i><span class="en">Liv.
				45, 31</span></i>.</div>
